  "summary": "The separate native cooperative owning-thread client control passes exact two-phase RGB,eleven scope/transition refusals,blank/stale rejection,three-second hung-paint timeout and independent supervisor-handle-loss retirement. Query-only handles are transferred to the assigned suspended child;no GDI handle crosses processes. The original32MiB capacity/confinement/interruption proof and eight byte-I/O controls pass;all16 calls retire. All21 raw entries replay and two retained PNGs were visually inspected. Host suites run554 tests with eight skips;1327 structural checks and329-file source map pass. Owned guest/source/image/account and host work cleanup is verified;allocated backing growth was not measured. The primitive is not linked into DiskEd;product child rendering/transport,six product cases,full native qualification,main and original0.1.0/owner/release gates remain open.",
